invariant: INV-14
file: handshake_post.c
catches: unit
reason: a KeyUpdate whose request_update is neither 0 nor 1 is refused with
  unexpected_message again, where RFC 9846 section 4.7.3 requires
  illegal_parameter (rfc9846.txt:3362-3365) and docs/server.md promises it.
  bin/unit requires illegal_parameter for 2 and for 255.

--- old
    if (body[0] > 1) {
        *alert = ALERT_ILLEGAL_PARAMETER;
        return CH_EPROTO;
    }
--- new
    if (body[0] > 1) {
        (void)alert;
        return CH_EPROTO;
    }
